00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:32.700
These two examples I've
thrown up on the screen

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:37.530
are two disparate
cases cited from EFF.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:41.160
The first being the
Freedom of Information Act

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.450
fine of the year.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.810
Someone wanted to
know information

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:50.250
about sexual assault
in Texas prisons.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:53.220
It's the type of information
that's a critical health

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.440
question for our country.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.290
And there were advocates
and data scientists

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:02.550
out there who spend hours
of their free time writing

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:06.240
into government organizations
asking for information.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:09.780
It was going to cost
